{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-hen-eagle","revision":1,"title_en":"Hen and Eagle","title_zh":"母鸡与老鹰","level":"B1","primary_topic":"literature","tags":["literature","animals","folktale"],"source_type":"licensed_original","fiction":true,"summary_zh":"从前母鸡和老鹰是无法飞翔的好朋友。遭遇饥荒后，母鸡提议用捡拾的羽毛缝制翅膀，老鹰借出唯一的骨针先缝好翅膀飞上高空。母鸡因偷懒未缝好翅膀便将针借给其他鸟类，导致骨针遗失在沙堆中。愤怒的老鹰限期索回，未果后抓走小鸡作为抵押，自此母鸡总在沙地刨土寻针，老鹰则盘旋扑食雏鸡。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-22T02:56:13Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"Once upon a time, Hen and Eagle were friends.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"从前，母鸡和老鹰是一对好朋友。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":4,"surface":"Once","lemma":"once","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"曾经；从前"},{"start":5,"end":9,"surface":"upon","lemma":"upon","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……之上"},{"start":10,"end":11,"surface":"a","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一个"},{"start":12,"end":16,"surface":"time","lemma":"time","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"时代；时光"},{"start":18,"end":21,"surface":"Hen","lemma":"Hen","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"母鸡"},{"start":22,"end":25,"surface":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"和；与"},{"start":26,"end":31,"surface":"Eagle","lemma":"Eagle","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"老鹰"},{"start":32,"end":36,"surface":"were","lemma":"be","pos":"系动词","gloss_zh":"是"},{"start":37,"end":44,"surface":"friends","lemma":"friend","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"朋友"}],"phrases":[{"start":0,"end":16,"surface":"Once upon a time","gloss_zh":"从前；很久以前"}]},{"id":"s2","text":"They lived in peace with all the other birds.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"它们和所有其他鸟类和睦地生活在一起。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":4,"surface":"They","lemma":"they","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"它们"},{"start":5,"end":10,"surface":"lived","lemma":"live","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"生活；居住"},{"start":11,"end":13,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"处于……之中"},{"start":14,"end":19,"surface":"peace","lemma":"peace","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"和平；和睦"},{"start":20,"end":24,"surface":"with","lemma":"with","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"与……一起"},{"start":25,"end":28,"surface":"all","lemma":"all","pos":"限定词","gloss_zh":"所有"},{"start":29,"end":32,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"这些"},{"start":33,"end":38,"surface":"other","lemma":"other","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"其他的"},{"start":39,"end":44,"surface":"birds","lemma":"bird","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"鸟类"}],"phrases":[{"start":11,"end":19,"surface":"in peace","gloss_zh":"和睦地；平安地"}]},{"id":"s3","text":"None of them could fly.","separator_after":"","translation_zh":"它们当中没有谁能够飞翔。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":4,"surface":"None","lemma":"none","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"没有一个"},{"start":5,"end":7,"surface":"of","lemma":"of","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……之中"},{"start":8,"end":12,"surface":"them","lemma":"they","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"它们"},{"start":13,"end":18,"surface":"could","lemma":"can","pos":"情态动词","gloss_zh":"能够"},{"start":19,"end":22,"surface":"fly","lemma":"fly","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"飞翔"}],"phrases":[{"start":0,"end":12,"surface":"None of them","gloss_zh":"它们中没有一个"}]}]},{"sentences":[{"id":"s4","text":"One day, there was famine in the land.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"有一天，这片土地上发生了饥荒。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":3,"surface":"One","lemma":"one","pos":"数词","gloss_zh":"一个"},{"start":4,"end":7,"surface":"day","lemma":"day","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"天；日子"},{"start":9,"end":14,"surface":"there","lemma":"there","pos":"引导词","gloss_zh":"有（there be结构）"},{"start":15,"end":18,"surface":"was","lemma":"be","pos":"系动词","gloss_zh":"发生；存在"},{"start":19,"end":25,"surface":"famine","lemma":"famine","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"饥荒"},{"start":26,"end":28,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……之中"},{"start":29,"end":32,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"这片"},{"start":33,"end":37,"surface":"land","lemma":"land","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"土地；大地"}],"phrases":[{"start":0,"end":7,"surface":"One day","gloss_zh":"有一天"}]},{"id":"s5","text":"Eagle had to walk very far to find food.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"老鹰不得不走很远的路去寻找食物。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":5,"surface":"Eagle",